{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...my sister. I'm... trying to atone for her death, and I was wondering... would you allow me to put up a small monument for her here, by the pond I normally meditate in? Like a gravestone, though of course with no body... I feel like it would help me.'","created_at":"2021-08-16T19:25:17.574000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876909502446854185","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Nothing super fancy, or distracting. Just... something small, to help me remember.'","created_at":"2021-08-16T19:25:38.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876909591064088576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You may do that, but only if you make it yourself..... with your own hands\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T19:25:52.052000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876909647058067466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Of course.'","created_at":"2021-08-16T19:26:42.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876909859050778626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
